 way to the legendary Golden Banana, and complete an interstellar pilgrimage    only an ape could dream of.\n\n  \ud83c\udfae Key Features\n  - \ud83e\uddd7 True Hands-On Climbing \u2014 Immersive VR hand-tracking\nwith no stick locomotion. Every grip is decided by     your own hands.\n  - \ud83c\udf0d A Three-Act Journey \u2014 Ground \u2192 Sky \u2192 Space. Environments and challenges escalate as you climb higher.    \n  - \ud83d\udc64 Solo or Co-op \u2014 Take on the climb alone, or join online to explore the stars\n  - \ud83d\udc7e Alien Threats \u2014 Dodge UFO lasers and incoming stones from Slime creatures in the final act.\n  - \ud83c\udf4c The Golden Banana \u2014 A clear, myth-driven goal that guides your pilgrimage from start to finish.\n  - \u26a1 Physics-Driven Feedback \u2014 Real hand collisions, weighty falls, and tense stamina management.", "short_description": "Monke Mountain is a VR climbing adventure for solo players and co-op duos alike. Scale the mountains, board  a starship in the skies, and venture into space to reach the legendary Golden Banana \u2014 climb it alone, or bring a friend."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.chummi.sg/monke-mountain", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CHUMMI PTE. LTD", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.chummi.sg/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "su